                "end_index": 1285,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **Muscle Aches and Stiffness:** High blood calcium levels (hypercalcemia) frequently cause muscle weakness, generalized joint aches, and muscle tension"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1287,
                "end_index": 1396,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Patients often report this feeling as persistent, tight \"muscle knots\" or stiffness in the neck and shoulders"
