              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2271,
                "end_index": 2451,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **Large Parathyroid Adenomas or Cysts:** While normal glands are tiny, a parathyroid adenoma (a benign tumor) can sometimes grow quite large (occasionally the size of a walnut)"
